// HZM coop [user 2026-08-19] NEAR-IMPACT SNAP takes - sharp positional crack layered over
// the stock bullet-hole sound when a round strikes a surface near the listener
// (cg_parsemsg.cpp, coop_impactSnap/coop_impactSnapDist). Reuses the supersonic-crack wavs
// pitched up so the impact snap and the head-crack read as different events.
aliascache snd_b_impactsnap1 sound/coop_crack/crack_01.wav soundparms 1.1 0.1 1.15 0.1 120 1400 auto loaded
aliascache snd_b_impactsnap2 sound/coop_crack/crack_02.wav soundparms 1.1 0.1 1.15 0.1 120 1400 auto loaded
aliascache snd_b_impactsnap3 sound/coop_crack/crack_03.wav soundparms 1.1 0.1 1.15 0.1 120 1400 auto loaded
